      "text": "I will be merciful unto the Gentiles in that day, 1 Ne. 13:34. if the Gentiles shall hearken unto the Lamb of God, 1 Ne. 14:1. Lord will surely prepare a way for his people, 1 Ne. 22:20. choice seer will I raise up, 2 Ne. 3:7. to bring about the restoration of his people, 2 Ne. 30:8 (30:3–8). labor diligently … that we may prepare the way, Jacob 5:61. last time that I shall nourish my vineyard, Jacob 5:71. I will establish my church, 3 Ne. 21:22. faithful … lifted up to dwell in the kingdom prepared for him, Ether 4:19.",
