      "text": "prepare ye for that which is to come, D&C 1:12. thou art called to prune my vineyard, D&C 24:19. prepare their hearts and be prepared in all things, D&C 29:8. in time … I will be your king and watch over you, D&C 38:21. reserve unto myself a pure people, D&C 43:14 (100:16). preparing of the way before the time of his coming, D&C 77:12. prepare for the revelation … when … all flesh shall see me, D&C 101:23. prepare my people for the time when I shall dwell with them, D&C 104:59. My people must be tried in all things, D&C 136:31.",
